<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="so">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Talooyin iyo digniino ku saabsan badbaadada WhatsApp iyo ka fogaanshaha khiyaanooyinka.">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#075e54">

  <title>Badbaado WhatsApp</title>

  <style>
    :root{
      --green:#075e54;
      --green2:#128c7e;
      --pale:#e8f5ef;
      --ink:#18312c;
      --muted:#526760;
      --line:#d6e5de;
      --white:#fff;
      --warn:#fff4d6;
    }

    *{
      box-sizing:border-box;
    }

    body{
      margin:0;
      background:#edf4f0;
      color:var(--ink);
      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
      line-height:1.6;
    }

    header{
      background:var(--green);
      color:white;
      padding:22px 16px;
    }

    .wrap{
      width:min(920px,100% - 28px);
      margin:auto;
    }

    .brand{
      font-size:1.45rem;
      font-weight:800;
    }

    .sub{
      font-size:.94rem;
      opacity:.92;
    }

    main{
      padding:22px 0 38px;
    }

    .hero,
    .panel{
      background:white;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:18px;
      padding:22px;
      margin-bottom:18px;
      box-shadow:0 6px 20px #163e2b0b;
    }

    .pill{
      display:inline-block;
      background:var(--warn);
      padding:5px 10px;
      border-radius:20px;
      font-size:.82rem;
      font-weight:700;
      color:#755000;
    }

    h1{
      font-size:clamp(1.55rem,5vw,2.25rem);
      line-height:1.2;
      margin:13px 0;
    }

    h2{
      font-size:1.25rem;
      margin:0 0 12px;
    }

    p{
      margin:8px 0 12px;
    }

    .muted{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.94rem;
    }

    .tips{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
      gap:12px;
    }

    .tip{
      background:var(--pale);
      padding:14px;
      border-radius:12px;
    }

    .tip strong{
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:4px;
    }

    label{
      display:block;
      font-weight:700;
      margin:13px 0 6px;
    }

    textarea{
      width:100%;
      padding:13px;
      border:1px solid #a8c5b7;
      border-radius:10px;
      font-size:1rem;
      resize:vertical;
      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
    }

    button{
      width:100%;
      border:0;
      border-radius:10px;
      background:var(--green2);
      color:white;
      font-size:1rem;
      font-weight:700;
      padding:14px;
      margin-top:14px;
      cursor:pointer;
    }

    button:hover{
      background:var(--green);
    }

    .notice{
      background:#f4f8f6;
      border-left:4px solid var(--green2);
      padding:12px;
      border-radius:8px;
      font-size:.91rem;
    }

    .result{
      display:none;
      padding:14px;
      border-radius:10px;
      background:var(--pale);
      margin-top:14px;
    }

    .phone-box{
      margin-top:16px;
      background:#e8f5ef;
      padding:18px;
      border-radius:12px;
      text-align:center;
    }

    .phone{
      font-size:1.3rem;
      font-weight:800;
      color:var(--green);
    }

    footer{
      padding:18px 0;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.88rem;
    }

    a{
      color:var(--green);
      text-decoration:underline;
    }

    .links{
      display:flex;
      gap:14px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand">💬 Badbaado WhatsApp</div>
    <div class="sub">Digniin • Talooyin • Wacyigelin</div>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">

  <section class="hero">

    <span class="pill">⚠️ OGEYSIIS AMNI</span>

    <h1>
      Ka digtoonow khiyaanooyinka WhatsApp
    </h1>

    <p>
      Ha ku degdegin fariimaha ku cabsi geliya ama kuu ballanqaada abaalmarin.
      Hubi qofka kula soo xiriiray, hana bixin xog sir ah.
    </p>

    <p class="muted">
      Boggan waa wacyigelin madax-bannaan;
      ma aha bog rasmi ah oo WhatsApp leeyahay mana matalo WhatsApp ama Meta.
    </p>

  </section>


  <section class="panel">

    <h2>🛡️ Sida aad isu ilaalin karto</h2>

    <div class="tips">

      <div class="tip">
        <strong>🔐 Ha bixin koodhka xaqiijinta</strong>
        Waligaa qof ha la wadaagin SMS code-ka ama PIN-kaaga.
      </div>

      <div class="tip">
        <strong>🔗 Ka fiirso linkiyada</strong>
        Ha furin link aanad garanayn, gaar ahaan kuwa degdeg kuugu cadaadinaya.
      </div>

      <div class="tip">
        <strong>✅ Daar xaqiijinta laba-tallaabo</strong>
        Ka eeg WhatsApp: Settings → Account → Two-step verification.
      </div>

      <div class="tip">
        <strong>💻 Hubi qalabka ku xiran</strong>
        Ka eeg Linked devices oo ka saar qalab aadan aqoon.
      </div>

      <div class="tip">
        <strong>💸 Xaqiiji codsiyada lacagta</strong>
        Qofka wac ama si kale u xaqiiji haddii uu lacag ku weydiisto.
      </div>

      <div class="tip">
        <strong>🚫 Ha bixin password</strong>
        Qof talo ku siinaya uma baahna password-kaaga, PIN-kaaga ama koodhkaaga.
      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="panel" id="xiriir">

    <h2>📩 Fariin noo reeb</h2>

    <p>
      Haddii aad qabto su'aal ama aad u baahan tahay talo ku saabsan
      badbaadada WhatsApp, fariintaada halkan ku qor.
    </p>

    <div class="notice">

      <strong>Asturnaanta:</strong>

      Kuma weydiinayno lambarkaaga telefoonka,
      WhatsApp code, PIN ama password.

      Fariintaada u qor si aan kuu fahanno,
      kadibna waxaad si toos ah ula xiriiri kartaa maamulaha
      adigoo isticmaalaya lambarka hoose.

    </div>


    <form id="messageForm">

      <label for="message">
        Fariintaada
      </label>

      <textarea
        id="message"
        name="message"
        rows="6"
        maxlength="1000"
        placeholder="Tusaale: Waxaan helay fariin iga codsanaysa WhatsApp code..."
        required>
      </textarea>

      <button type="submit">
        📨 Soo Dir Fariinta
      </button>

    </form>


    <div
      class="result"
      id="result"
      role="status"
      aria-live="polite">
    </div>


    <div class="phone-box">

      <strong>
        📞 Haddii aad rabto inaad si toos ah u soo wacdo:
      </strong>

      <div class="phone">
        +252 XX XXX XXXX
      </div>

      <p class="muted">
        ⚠️ Lambarkan ku beddel lambarkaaga ka hor intaadan website-ka daabicin.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="panel">

    <h2>🔒 Ogeysiiska asturnaanta</h2>

    <p>
      <strong>Xogta la ururinayo:</strong>
      Boggan ma weydiinayo ama ma ururinayo lambarka telefoonka qofka.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Ujeeddada:</strong>
      Fariinta qofku soo diro waxaa loogu talagalay oo keliya
      inuu sharaxo su'aashiisa ama dhibaatada amni ee uu la kulmay.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Xog sir ah:</strong>
      Ha ku qorin fariinta WhatsApp verification code,
      PIN, password ama xog kale oo sir ah.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Maamulka:</strong>
      Haddii fariimaha mustaqbalka lagu kaydiyo server/database,
      waa in lagu ilaaliyaa marin xaddidan.
    </p>

  </section>


  <footer>

    <div class="links">
      <a href="#xiriir">Codso talo</a>
      <a href="#xiriir">Asturnaanta</a>
    </div>

    <p>
      Wacyigelin amni oo madax-bannaan.
      Haddii aad u malaynayso in akoonkaaga la qabsaday,
      ha la wadaagin koodhka xaqiijinta.
    </p>

    <p>
      © Badbaado WhatsApp
    </p>

  </footer>

</main>


<script>

  document
    .getElementById('messageForm')
    .addEventListener('submit', function(event) {

      event.preventDefault();

      const message =
        document.getElementById('message').value.trim();

      const result =
        document.getElementById('result');


      if (!message) {

        result.style.display = 'block';

        result.textContent =
          'Fadlan fariintaada qor.';

        return;
      }


      result.style.display = 'block';

      result.innerHTML =
        '✅ <strong>Fariintaada waa la helay.</strong><br>' +
        'Wax yar i sug. Haddii aad rabto inaad si toos ah ula xiriirto, ' +
        'isticmaal lambarka ku qoran bogga.';


      document
        .getElementById('message')
        .value = '';

    });

</script>

</body>
</html>
